Erdos647Sieve — repository packaging, 2026-09-08

This distribution retains the project Lean source from the Erdős #647 research
workflow and the v31 attached-sum repair. Mathematical proof files are reproduced
without additional proof-body edits. Source provenance, historical axiom reports,
and supplied handoffs are retained under provenance/.

The Apache-2.0 license text is retained from the v31 package scaffold. Project
attribution and release ownership belong to the repository owner; this package
does not invent an author name or claim third-party authorship of project proofs.
Mathlib and PrimeNumberTheoremAnd are external Git dependencies with their own
licenses and notices. No third-party compiler binaries or complete library source
copies are bundled in this distribution.

